      },
      {
        "action_date": "2025-01-15",
        "text": "On passage Passed by the Yeas and Nays: 423 - 1 (Roll no. 15). (text: CR H160-164)",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2025-01-15",
        "text": "Passed/agreed to in House: On passage Passed by the Yeas and Nays: 423 - 1 (Roll no. 15). (text: CR H160-164)",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2025-01-15",
        "text": "Considered as unfinished business. (consideration: CR H170)",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2025-01-15",
        "text": "POSTPONED PROCEEDINGS - At the conclusion of debate on H.R. 33, the Chair put the question on passage and by voice vote, announced that the ayes had prevailed. Mr. Smith (MO) demanded the yeas and nays and the Chair postponed further proceedings until a time to be announced.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2025-01-15",
        "text": "The previous question was ordered pursuant to the rule.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2025-01-15",
        "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with one hour of debate on H.R. 33.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2025-01-15",
        "text": "Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 5. (consideration: CR H160-168)",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2025-01-03",
        "text": "Referred to the Committee on Ways and Means, and in addition to the Committee on Rules, for a period to be subsequently determined by the Speaker, in each case for consideration of such provisions as fall within the jurisdiction of the committee concerned.",
